When merging the custom blocklist from environment variables with the default blocklist, you are concatenating two arrays. This can result in duplicate entries if the user provides a pattern that is already in the default list. While this doesn't cause a functional problem, using a `Set` to merge the lists would produce a cleaner result with unique entries and more clearly state the intent.

